                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Peace Treaty With Italy</hi></p>
                <p>The Council continued the discussion in second reading of the un-agreed Articles
                    of the Italian Treaty.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Article 16, Free Territory of Trieste</hi>.</p>
                <p>The discussion of the amendments to this Article proposed by the U.S.S.R,
                    Delegation, set out in Document CFM(46)
                        (NY)13,<anchor n="19" xml:id="d328-f1"/> was resumed.</p>
                <p>After a further exchange of views on the respective powers of the Governor and
                    the Council of Government in the Free Territory, the discussion was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">adjourned</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Newt Meeting of the
                    Council</hi>.</p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to hold a private meeting of the
                    Council on Friday, November 15, at 4 p.m.</p>
